- Frontend: React with TypeScript: Component-based architecture with type safety; Tailwind CSS with shadcn/ui: Consistent design system, rapid development
- DevOps & Infrastructure: Docker: Containerization for consistent environments; GitHub Actions: CI/CD for automated testing and deployment; AWS or GCP: Cloud providers for scalable infrastructure

